Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是唐娜·汉斯姆警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sheriff Donna Hanscum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我丈夫道格去年离开我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband, Doug, left me last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说我喜欢饼干奶昔\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he said I loved cookie-dough milkshakes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-多过喜欢他  -你值得更好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- more than him. - You deserve better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-唐娜  -道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Donna. - Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可真漂亮啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aren't you looking good?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我减了6磅呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost 6 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.47,0:00:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经成功四分之一了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're 1/4 of the way there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,道格看上去像个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doug seems like kind of a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有想过世上有一些东西...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever think there are things out there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一些...不曾被警察记录在案的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}things that...don't end up in the police blotter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我看见了...牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I think I saw... were teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你觉得我疯了吧  -完全不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think I'm crazy?  - Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-她突然就抽出把刀  -丘斯警长是吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She just pulled out a machete. - Sheriff Cuse is a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唐娜看到了他的牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donna saw his teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼  吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the cuss?! A vampire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们伤不了你  他们伤不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't hurt you. They can't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会流血的怪物就能被杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it bleeds, you can kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是因为你害怕小丑  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about your, uh, your clown thing, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们到底把你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the world did they do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.34,0:01:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我看到了些幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've been having visions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.53,0:01:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是一些画面  更像是感觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just images. I mean, more of a feeling, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.43,0:01:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这幻觉是上帝给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe these visions are coming from God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  第一个幻觉是我祈祷后看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Dean, the first one happened after I prayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你祈祷了  什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You prayed? When was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在医院的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.04,0:01:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你祈祷什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you pray about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.63,0:01:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我就是在寻求答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I was just looking for answers, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.69,0:01:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝什么时候回应过我们的祈祷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time God answered any one of our prayers?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是加时赛的第二次跑垒得分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is their second drive in overtime,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.07,0:01:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两队都曾持球\N{\fnArial\fs30}with both teams having possessed the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.53,0:01:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下一分便能定胜局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next score wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一举一动都...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every play becomes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.95,0:01:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,32码线处的1号和10号\N{\fnArial\fs30}1st and 10 from the 32-yard line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.30,0:01:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能扔下垃圾吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you take out the trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他往左跑了  天呐...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is running left. Ohh! He gets...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.45,0:01:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直臭死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stinks to high heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.16,0:01:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你的厨艺太差\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your cooking that stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:01:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打加时赛呢  等等的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game's in O.T., can't it wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.69,0:02:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将他逼回中心  慢慢防守...\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Backs him into center, slowly defends...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.99,0:02:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  再给我拿瓶啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hon, bring me another Brewski.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.55,0:02:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他被赶出了袋形区\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's flushed out of the pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thanks, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.61,0:02:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还说不用设负鼠陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need possum traps, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.49,0:03:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第11季第7集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万一你还真在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the off chance that you're actually listening, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.67,0:03:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta be real honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些幻象我实在想不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}The visions aren't making a whole lot of sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我搞不清状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟想告诉我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.78,0:03:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你不是吧  -你知不知道什么叫隐私啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, really? - You ever hear of privacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要隐私就关门啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want privacy, close your door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是谈过这事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought we talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.49,0:04:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  迪恩  但你为什么这么不愿相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we did, Dean. But why is it so hard to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝在让我看到一些关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}that God could be sending me visions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-黑暗的幻觉  -开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- about the Darkness? - You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.13,0:04:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天启的时候他都没出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't feel the need to show up for the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在为什么就会在乎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he give a crap now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  或许因为那是他妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe because she's his sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎么办  坐视不管  不理会他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you wanna do? Sit back? Ignore him? Do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's... that's not what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  别指望上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying, don't count on God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,指望我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Count on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.45,0:04:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是小卡在加沙找到的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is everything Cass dug up in Gaza,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.77,0:04:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的圣经前传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}every last bit of prebiblical lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一半都没法看  是阿拉姆语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half of it I couldn't read. It's in Aramaic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.49,0:04:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other half...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全没提到黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a single mention of the Darkness, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.91,0:04:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我勒个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唐娜  你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donna, what's shakin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.28,0:04:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吸脂怪事件那个唐娜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fat sucker Donna?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫"杀人兔"\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean "killer bunny"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(明尼苏达州  卡蒂奇格罗夫)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(明尼苏达州  卡蒂奇格罗夫  拉森郡警局)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你俩太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are a sight for sore eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.45,0:05:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你辖区扩大了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you working all 10,000 lakes now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你平时的管辖区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't usually your beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只管拉森郡  因为裁员了嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just Larsen County, what with the cutbacks and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整体来说还是像美食一样美好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the most part, it's been tater tots and lemon drops,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}except for this doozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接到报案说有复活节兔子杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, when you get a call about a killer Easter bunny,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直不知道该怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't know what to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想这事太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you think crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且那人挺健壮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy's real strong, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲撞了好几个警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lashed out at several officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一整队人合力才把他关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took a whole team just to get him into custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.39,0:05:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这还不是最怪的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not the weirdest part...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那颗兔子头  拿不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}bunny head won't come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.63,0:05:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了上电锯什么都试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tried everything short of a chainsaw,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:05:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但就是取不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's really stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:05:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道呢  可能没什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who knows? Could be nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许那人的头像我叔叔沃利一样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy could just have a big melon like my uncle Wally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但自从我知道晚上都有什么妖魔鬼怪出没后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ever since I've seen what goes bump in the night...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我实在不想冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not taking any chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做得很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the right thing, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还不完全确定这事是我们的范畴内的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just still not 100% sure this is our kind of case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你这儿有只野兔(兔八哥)的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if, uh, you got a wild hare...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听懂我的意思了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what I did there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你俩太高兴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是谁啊  警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you got there, sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位  这是斯托弗警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, this is Officer Stover.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.74,0:06:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他负责这桩案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lead on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是艾略特和萨维奇探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents Elliott and Savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你很高兴  叫我道格就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet ya. And please, call me Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.28,0:06:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这两位先生会在兔子案上帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}These two fine fellas will be helping out with the old hippity hop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会需要帮助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,倒不是说汉斯姆警长做得有什么不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not that Sheriff Hanscum isn't doing a bang-up job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有她在是我们的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're lucky to have her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.91,0:07:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我回去工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I better get back to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不关我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's none of our business,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但某人似乎喜欢上某人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it looks like somebody might have a crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是晚上出生的  迪恩  但不是昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born at night, Dean. Not last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  他似乎挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the deal? He seems nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他是警察  还叫道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's a cop... Named Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我显然是有固定的类型\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, clearly, I have a type,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不要再犯错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no, thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一朝被狗咬  十年怕道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't be once bitten, twice Doug'd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  那只兔子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, where's the Wascally Wabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有目击证人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any witnesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  被害人妻子  芙兰·辛克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, vic's wife... Fran Hinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:07:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜人以为她要下个没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor thing thought she was next,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.63,0:08:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但兔子就直接起来出门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the bunny just up and walked out the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-确认他身份了吗  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You I.D. Him yet? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有钱包  没有电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wallet. No cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查了指纹  但没有前科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ran his prints, but no prior record.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都没法控制他足够久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't even get our hands on him long enough
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.37,0:08:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查看有没有什么明显标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}to check for any identifying marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只知道  他是白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only thing we do know... he's caucasian,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.21,0:08:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概18到25岁之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}roughly 18 to 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.53,0:08:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且很吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱夫打来了  说是急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clive's on the line. Said it's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果需要我  说一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shoot a hoot if you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.77,0:08:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要什么吗  油煎饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need anything? Crullers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能开口会容易得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be easier all around if you just talk to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.47,0:08:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-小心  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Careful. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摇头丸吃多了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you dropped too much molly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把面具用超级胶水粘在头上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super glue your mask to your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后偏执发作  就捅死个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}get paranoid, stab a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也经历过啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.71,0:09:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜  兔子罗杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess, Rog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.51,0:09:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是被陷害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were framed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.51,0:09:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.38,0:09:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能行  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.43,0:09:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不是恶魔  -他真有劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not a demon. - He is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(明尼苏达理工大学)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远爱凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Kylie forever."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.61,0:09:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个能用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,名单上最后一个凯莉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last Kylie on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰  凯莉·詹宁斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Kylie Jennings?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,认识这只兔子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你们找到他了  -他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You found him. - Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.65,0:10:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克·胡克斯  我男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike Hooks. He's my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你知道你男朋友为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, you have any idea why your boyfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要捅死人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would stab somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.64,0:10:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克和斯坦·辛克尔怎么认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would Mike know Stan Hinkle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-谁  -被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - The victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  这没道理啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold on. This... This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.67,0:10:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克为什么要捅死一个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Mike stab a complete stranger? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-天呐  -怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我本以为没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I thought it was nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他昨天怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was acting really weird yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们下课后去了一间旧货店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, after class, we went to this thrift shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要为校外的一个派对买服装\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed to buy costumes for a party off-campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克找到一个特别吓人的兔子面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mike found this super creepy bunny mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.44,0:10:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我简直恶心死了  但他特别喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it... it grossed me out, which he just loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.90,0:10:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他一戴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as soon as he put it on...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就开始怪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when the weird started?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  他...盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He just... stared at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.60,0:10:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起初我以为他是在胡闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first, I thought that he was just messing around,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:10:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他直接走出了商店  都没付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then he walked out without paying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还把手机留在了收银台\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left his cell at the register,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也没办法联系他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I had no way of reaching him, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克人可好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Mike's, like, the sweetest, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我告诉你们  他一戴上那个面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you, as soon as he put that mask on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就像变了个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's like he was a completely different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得医院能把这东西取下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think the hospital can get this puppy off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.77,0:11:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,俩字  骨锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two words... bone saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, let's see here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女警就干不了重活儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady cops can't handle the heavy liftin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.33,0:11:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just figured...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们给他打了一堆镇静剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shot him full of tranquilizers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很沉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怕你伤到自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you to hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伤到自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hurt myself"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.36,0:11:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是有锻炼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do crossfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,激发内心潜能  用膝盖去抬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just gotta engage the core and lift with the knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙能死啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little help would be nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.91,0:12:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Oh, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those FBI boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个19岁的孩子死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A 19-year-old kid is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.91,0:13:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不怪你或道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not on you or Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.69,0:13:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是在尽职\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just doing his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid was innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.53,0:13:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果面具被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if the mask was cursed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那他就只是傀儡  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he was just a puppet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他也是受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was victim, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再不会有别人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.61,0:13:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会再这样死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  再来一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  巴克纳  你的努力都会有回报的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice job, Buckner. All your hard work's gonna pay off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你真这么觉得  教练  -我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think so, coach? - I know so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.87,0:14:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,球探不要你就是他傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any scout would be a damn fool not to snatch you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别吃生长激素了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just lay off the H.G.H.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可能得做药检\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might have to pee in a cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果还需要练习  我就在隔壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be next door if you need another spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(卡蒂奇格罗夫高中  球场小丑)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.21,0:15:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要再来一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need another spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.15,0:16:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(犯罪现场  止步)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好消息  教练还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news... coach is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.44,0:16:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坏消息  他陷入昏迷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news... he's in a coma,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以还不算没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're not out of the woods yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.37,0:16:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连着两天两个戴面具的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two masked psychos in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太巧了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what are the chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是模仿犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess? Copycat killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.07,0:16:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都怪社交网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn social media.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嗯  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们跟那孩子谈过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, did you guys talk to the kid yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.98,0:17:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-请便  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be my guest. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾略特和萨维奇探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents Elliott and Savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.39,0:17:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布洛克·巴克纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brock Buckner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布洛克  你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um, Brock, what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.97,0:17:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没看到多少  我当时正在锻炼二头肌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much, man. I mean, I was just hammering my bi's,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.84,0:17:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,练得正起劲  紧接着\N{\fnArial\fs30}gettin' all swole, and next thing I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就看到埃文斯教练被吉祥物打趴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coach Evans is getting his ass kicked by the mascot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉祥物是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who is the mascot?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.91,0:17:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会知道  我是四分卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I know? I'm the quarterback.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  他的面具摘不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, his mask wouldn't come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他强壮得难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't believe how strong he was either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他长得那么瘦  却跟我一样有劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, for a scrawny dude, he was as strong as me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是州举重冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I hold the state bench record.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.49,0:17:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  你举多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? What do you bench?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.36,0:17:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,四块盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每边四块\N{\fnArial\fs30}On each side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了面具摘不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so other than the, uh, mask not coming off
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.18,0:17:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小丑变身绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the jester hulking out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还注意到其他奇怪之处了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you notice anything else unusual?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电涌  温度变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, power surges? Temperature fluctuations?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.21,0:17:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,举重室之前的确突然冷了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the weight room did get really cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是诅咒物件\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't a cursed object.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是鬼魂附身  -老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ghost possession. - Oh, for jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-鬼能附身人  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ghosts can possess people? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.56,0:18:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂基础知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, ghosts 101...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个人的灵魂可以附在一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's spirit can attach itself to an object
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或多件其遗留下来的物件上\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a bunch of objects left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这件案子里  就是面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this case, masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  那么拿到物件的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, so whoever possesses the object...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就会被附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gets possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我们不能把面具取下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we can't get the mask off,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么打破附身啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}how the heck do ya unpossess someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切事物都有弱点  鬼魂也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything has a weakness, even ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.70,0:18:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们讨厌铁和盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hate iron and salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.12,0:18:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只需要用盐来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all we gotta do is spook the spook
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吓唬一下鬼魂  或许可以给撬下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a little salt and, uh, maybe we could pry it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的节食秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}My diet secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咬一口甜点  就往上撒盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}One bite of dessert and then I dump salt on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻没胃口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kills the craving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好用吗  -当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that works? - You betcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对什么都好使  除了咸味焦糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}On everything except... salted caramel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}something a little bit more like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.86,0:19:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说不会再死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said no one else was dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是盐弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt pellets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜人不该被关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor thing doesn't deserve to be locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就放她走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人看到她的脸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one saw her face, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  凶手就是个流浪汉  打倒了你  逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he was a drifter, overpowered you, escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太伤妹子自尊了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's some female empowerment for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just gonna ask you a few questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你就可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.35,0:20:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.63,0:20:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scout's honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得自己袭击埃文斯教练吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember attacking Coach Evans?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不记得  我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去取新的吉祥物服装\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to pick up the new mascot costume,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后试了一下  紧接着\N{\fnArial\fs30}went to try it on, and the next thing I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就在监狱里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认识他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you even know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他上学期是我的体育课教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my P.E. coach last semester.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.81,0:20:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他挺严厉的  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he was kind of a hard-ass, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不代表我希望他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't mean that I wanted him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米歇尔  你的服装哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle, where did you get the costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是旧货店吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it a thrift store?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  是有人捐给学校的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, someone donated it to the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丽塔·约翰逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rita Johnson?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  你们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, who's askin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有几个关于镇上一桩案子的问题要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a few questions we want to ask you about a case in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁啊  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it, mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯  回去完成作业吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, Max, why don't you go back and finish your homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.04,0:20:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警察为什么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are the police here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子  见过真正的警车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, fella. You ever see a real cop car?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.54,0:20:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你妈不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if it's okay with your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.52,0:20:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.01,0:20:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你可以用警用无线电  -真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can talk on the police radio. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.91,0:20:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-很容易学的  -太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's pretty simple to figure out. - Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:20:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if we come inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,服装是我弟弟  切斯特的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The costumes belonged to my brother Chester.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他生前是个儿童派对表演者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a kids' party performer before he passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,切斯特是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, um, how did... how did Chester die?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟患有抑郁症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, my brother suffered from depression.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几个月前自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took his own life a couple months back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.25,0:21:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跳桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumped off a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯求我留下服装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max begged me to keep the costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.09,0:21:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很喜欢  他爱他舅舅\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loved them. He loved his uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们一起住  所以他们很亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he lived with us, so they were really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我看了只觉得伤心  于是就捐出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they made me sad, so I donated them
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捐给了本地高中  剧团\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the local high school, the theater company.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有旧货店吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrift shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  都是那种地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, places like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能问问切斯特葬在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask where Chester's buried?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.01,0:21:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有土葬  是火葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not. He was cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能给他的服装列个清单吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind making a list of his costumes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.37,0:21:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能记得多少是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}As many as you can remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  但这跟你们的案子有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. But what does this have to do with your case?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也想查清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're trying to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.94,0:21:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, one more question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.99,0:22:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,切斯特跟斯坦·辛克尔或菲尔·埃文斯有过结吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Chester have a falling out with Stan Hinkle or Phil Evans?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.43,0:22:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者是任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, or anyone for that matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.31,0:22:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.07,0:22:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟谁有什么未了结的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did he have any unfinished business with anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.23,0:22:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我觉得没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not that I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.76,0:22:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't even...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.24,0:22:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得切斯特都不认识这俩人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think Chester even knew those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.97,0:22:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得切斯特的自杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember Chester's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.24,0:22:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.40,0:22:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们知道他就是那个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now that we know he's the ghost,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.09,0:22:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么制止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do we stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.49,0:22:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一般是要烧掉尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, usually you gotta burn their bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他是火葬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.59,0:22:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们是没办法喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're up poop's creek without a paddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他似乎是附在服装上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, looks like he's tied to the costumes,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么想阻止他  就得烧掉服装\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means the only way to stop him is to burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.09,0:22:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们已经领先了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we're already ahead of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我让道格去高中取服装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had Doug go to the high school and collect the costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.08,0:22:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是其他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is a list of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.01,0:22:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和道格能给收集来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you and Doug can round 'em up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.15,0:22:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You betcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们只需要查清切斯特跟被害人什么仇怨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we just gotta figure out what Chester's beef was with the vics.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂一般为私事回来纠缠活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts come back for something personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.33,0:22:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通常是复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually, it's revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.71,0:23:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送我去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, drop me off at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.36,0:23:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去看看教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check on the coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.32,0:23:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去找找斯坦的遗孀  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see if I can find Stan's widow. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.94,0:25:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.05,0:25:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你问出什么来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a story out of bozo?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.30,0:25:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  他叫史蒂夫·布勒斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, name is Steve Buress.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.49,0:25:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,60岁了  退休医师\N{\fnArial\fs30}60 years old, retired G.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.17,0:25:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据说是在跟孙子玩变装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, he was playing dress-up with his grandson,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.57,0:25:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,紧接着就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the next thing he knew, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.68,0:25:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都不知道自己怎么来到医院的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't even know how he got to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.46,0:25:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他也"逃"了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He "escape," too?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.77,0:25:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.34,0:25:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对要丢掉饭碗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so losing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.56,0:26:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正往伍德伯里去拿一套啄木鸟的服装\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on my way to Woodbury to pick up a woodpecker costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.58,0:26:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后就听说了教练的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I got the call about the coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.71,0:26:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  这次是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.64,0:26:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀人小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killer clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.58,0:26:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经发布了通告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already put out an A.P.B.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.99,0:26:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这小镇是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the heck is going on in this doggone town?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.02,0:26:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了  模仿犯啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told ya. Copycat killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.31,0:26:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是模仿模仿犯的模仿犯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is a-a copycat of a copycat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.13,0:26:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了  道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.17,0:26:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没那么难理解吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that hard to wrap your noggin around, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.38,0:26:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听你的  警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you say, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.53,0:26:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去取那套啄木鸟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get the woodpecker.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.09,0:26:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事  你不能好好对他一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the deal? Why don't you cut the guy a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.21,0:26:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换了我也不信你那套啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I wouldn't be buying what you're selling either.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.90,0:26:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间应付不服管的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time for insubordination.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.49,0:26:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你是因为老道格而迁怒新道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is it maybe that you're treating new Doug like old Doug
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.39,0:26:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连个机会都不给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not even giving him a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.72,0:26:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我怎么想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.83,0:27:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该少管闲事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to mind your own beeswax.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.02,0:27:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还得破案呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a case to solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.04,0:27:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲尔和斯坦是大学室友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phil and Stan were college roommates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.94,0:27:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,18岁就认识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knew each other since they were 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.06,0:27:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像兄弟一样亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were like brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.53,0:27:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么多年的交情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of all these years of friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.42,0:27:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你丈夫或教练认不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}did, uh, your husband or the coach ever know a guy
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.60,0:27:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个切斯特·约翰逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the name of Chester Johnson?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.58,0:27:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个儿童派对表演者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a children's performer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.82,0:27:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. They knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.69,0:27:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不想说他的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even say his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.71,0:27:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他让我恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.21,0:27:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道不该说死人的坏话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you shouldn't speak ill of the dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.75,0:27:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但对那人  我没有任何好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have nothing nice to say about that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.93,0:27:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀人小丑  真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killer clown? You're serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.75,0:27:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  迪恩  我开玩笑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean, I'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.23,0:27:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我可喜欢小丑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because clowns are really funny to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.54,0:27:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你搞定了吗  -搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you take care of it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.82,0:27:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢  有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.14,0:27:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  原来斯坦和教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, turns out that Stan and the coach
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.49,0:27:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早就是死党了\N{\fnArial\fs30}were besties from way back
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.94,0:28:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们曾指控切斯特跟他们的孩子们过于亲密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who accused Chester of crossing the line with their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.12,0:28:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.14,0:28:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们没去找警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they didn't wanna go to the cops
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.08,0:28:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为不想让他们的孩子们尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause they didn't wanna embarrass their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.36,0:28:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是他们决定自己去追踪切斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they decided to track down Chester themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.88,0:28:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们去了他家  却见到了丽塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went to his house and got Rita instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.13,0:28:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说她说谎了  切斯特其实认识被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30} So she lied? Chester did know the vics?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.33,0:28:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来是的  芙兰说丽塔让他们滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently. So Fran said that Rita told them to screw off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.42,0:28:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后  他们还没机会跟他正面交锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...Well, before they had a chance to confront him,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.92,0:28:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he killed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.77,0:28:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  是自杀导致了复仇鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So suicide led to a vengeful spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.17,0:28:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们以前也不是没见过这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not like we haven't seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.03,0:28:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也可能不是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe it wasn't suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.11,0:28:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是麦克斯  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, Max, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.42,0:28:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈在家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is, uh, is your mom home?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.69,0:28:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-还没回来  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not yet. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.46,0:28:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想再问她几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I just needed to ask her a few more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.38,0:28:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就进来等吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I guess you can wait inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.66,0:28:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.10,0:29:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扑克啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poker?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.02,0:29:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能教你一两招\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can show you a move or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.33,0:29:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.14,0:29:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我舅舅教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something my uncle taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.25,0:29:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟他挺亲的  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you were pretty close to him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.59,0:29:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.75,0:29:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很酷  我很想他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was cool. I miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.61,0:29:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他听起来像个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sounds like a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.46,0:29:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些人说他的事  不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What those men said about him wasn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.08,0:29:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢你趁我不在家的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't appreciate you talking to my son
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.76,0:29:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我儿子说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I am not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.85,0:29:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是在交流一些纸牌技巧  仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we were just trading some card tricks, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.96,0:29:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来干什么  我知道的都告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you even doing here? I told you everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.93,0:29:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  亲爱的  回你房间去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, honey, go to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.11,0:29:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we know
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.75,0:29:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,教练和斯坦因为切斯特的事找过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the coach and Stan confronted you about Chester.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.12,0:29:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那跟你们没有半点关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is none of your damn business.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.59,0:29:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那跟这一切都没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has nothing to do with any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.19,0:29:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些人被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those men were murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.68,0:30:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你信不信  你弟弟跟这事有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whether or not you believe it, your brother is connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.28,0:30:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会  切斯特已经死了  他自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? Chester is dead. Killed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.19,0:30:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.36,0:30:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们得知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we need to know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.36,0:30:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事关人命\N{\fnArial\fs30}People's lives are at stake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.94,0:30:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  甚至是你的命  麦克斯的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Maybe yours. Maybe Max's.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.47,0:30:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.43,0:30:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.71,0:30:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几个月前  斯坦和教练来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of months ago, Stan and the coach came by.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.92,0:30:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说切斯特对他们的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said that Chester was with their kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.94,0:30:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做了些\N{\fnArial\fs30}did something...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.75,0:30:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不合适的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.89,0:30:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我选择了维护亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got defensive. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.80,0:30:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,切斯特人很好  对麦克斯就像父亲一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chester was sweet, like a dad to Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.67,0:30:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我让他们滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I told them to get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.62,0:30:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是他们对切斯特有意见  可以去找警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they had a problem with Chester, they could go to the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.60,0:30:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可他们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.63,0:30:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们没有任何证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't have any evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.79,0:30:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但接下来  我也开始怀疑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, I started to have my doubts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.57,0:31:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我很想维护我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, as much as I wanted to defend my brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.70,0:31:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们说的实在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they said really...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.72,0:31:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我如鲠在喉\N{\fnArial\fs30}got under my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.19,0:31:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,切斯特一直有点...不合群\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chester was always a little... Off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.97,0:31:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只跟孩子们处得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only got along with kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.19,0:31:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他才会做派对表演者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he became a party performer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.22,0:31:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一辈子都在维护我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent my whole life sticking up for my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.96,0:31:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可要是我没看清他的真面目呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if I couldn't see him for who he really was?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.69,0:31:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他跟麦克斯那么亲近\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he and Max were so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.25,0:31:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.24,0:31:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是他一直在伤害他  而我不知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what if he was hurting him, and I didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.77,0:31:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,切斯特是我弟弟  可是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chester was my brother, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.90,0:31:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max is my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.12,0:31:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你想保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you wanted to protect him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.06,0:31:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能视而不见啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I look the other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.35,0:31:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须鼓起勇气面对我最害怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to suck it up and face my biggest fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.47,0:31:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不做  还有谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not me, then who?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.69,0:31:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我应该和他谈谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I should've talked to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.02,0:32:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该先去找他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just should've gone to him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.62,0:32:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.02,0:32:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我却把斯坦叫回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called Stan back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.19,0:32:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他说他们会搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he said that they would take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.21,0:32:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(松景中学)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.88,0:32:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有天切斯特去表演的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So one day when Chester was working,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.32,0:32:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把他的行踪告诉了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them where he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.37,0:32:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.86,0:32:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.19,0:32:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别指望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.47,0:32:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.13,0:32:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命  救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.17,0:32:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们保证我不会伤害切斯特的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They promised me that they weren't gonna hurt Chester.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.55,0:32:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就只是吓唬吓唬他而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were just gonna scare him a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.55,0:32:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还想  也许好好吓他一顿...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought, you know, maybe a good scare..,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.41,0:32:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就安生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe that's all he needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.43,0:33:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手  住手  求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.38,0:33:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手  你们为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Why are you doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.25,0:33:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么  变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why, sicko!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.09,0:33:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离我们的孩子远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave our kids alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.44,0:33:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没伤害过你们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never hurt your kids
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.98,0:33:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者任何人的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}or anyone's kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.07,0:33:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.27,0:33:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we know!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.01,0:33:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我  放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go. Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.33,0:33:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-别动  我们不会...  -放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it! We're not gonna -- - Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.14,0:33:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-别动了  我们不...  -放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it! We won't -- - Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.45,0:33:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-放开我  -别乱动  别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, let me go! - Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.53,0:33:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是有意要杀他的  他们说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't mean to kill him. They -- they said...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.05,0:33:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是场意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.54,0:33:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我当时又不在场  所以也不知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wasn't there, so I didn't know what to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.99,0:33:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本想去找警察  把事情解释清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanted to go to the cops and explain what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.04,0:33:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但斯坦说我们都会进监狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Stan said that we'd all go to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.84,0:34:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能那样对麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I couldn't do that to Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.67,0:34:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经失去了父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He already lost his father
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.00,0:34:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有舅舅\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.74,0:34:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不能再失去我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he... he couldn't lose me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.94,0:34:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我...保持了沉默\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I...didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.04,0:34:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐惧会让人无力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear cripples you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.59,0:34:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让人袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes you do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.32,0:34:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者更糟...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.02,0:34:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让人做出会令自己后悔的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes you do something that you regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.38,0:34:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本该相信我弟弟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've trusted my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.02,0:34:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.88,0:34:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有服装都找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracked down every last costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.79,0:34:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会碰巧看见了一个鹿头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't happen to see a-a deer head by chance, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.63,0:34:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鹿头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deer head?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.79,0:34:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.07,0:35:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,单子上没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.43,0:35:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Max?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.40,0:35:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯  麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max? Max?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.73,0:35:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯  麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max? Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.75,0:35:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯  麦克斯  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max. Max, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.53,0:35:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么  麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? M-max!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.29,0:35:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.37,0:35:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.30,0:35:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快拿去烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.21,0:35:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.81,0:36:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.64,0:36:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  无论如何  待在这个圈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Whatever you do, stay inside this circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.28,0:36:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我不明白  -有鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't understand. - Ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.45,0:36:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道这事怎么跟你弟弟有关吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know how this ties to your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.23,0:36:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因果报应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.76,0:36:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,含冤而亡就会催生复仇鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrongful death spawns a vengeful spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.14,0:36:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,切斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chester.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,切斯特舅舅  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Chester, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.63,0:37:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们该...\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}All right, I think it's, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.40,0:37:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}time we gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.89,0:38:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你们下次再来明尼苏达州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's hoping something less murderous
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.15,0:38:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为不这么凶残的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}brings you back to Minnesota,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.54,0:38:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如普林斯(爵士歌手)或者奶酪块节\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Prince or Cheese Curd Fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.19,0:38:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"块"这字戳中我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had me at "curd."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.18,0:38:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你俩是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know how you two do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.65,0:38:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,日复一日\N{\fnArial\fs30}day in, day out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.32,0:38:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,调查谁被附身  谁没被附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figuring out who's possessed, who isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.13,0:38:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的生活简直就像一坨屎  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life's one big poop storm, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.67,0:38:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这话真有猎人的样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoken like a true hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.66,0:38:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.93,0:38:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-猎人  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hunter? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.83,0:38:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经解决了三个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, with three cases under your belt,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.09,0:38:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这是你应得的称呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.21,0:38:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.50,0:38:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.16,0:38:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.92,0:38:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.56,0:38:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.78,0:38:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.87,0:38:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.52,0:38:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这几天真疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been a crazy couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.78,0:38:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darn tootin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.11,0:38:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你做的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've been great.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.70,0:38:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的非常感谢你的努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really appreciate all your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.30,0:38:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.32,0:38:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉我对你有些严厉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry if I was a little tough on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.57,0:39:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说把我当做出气筒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you treating me like a punching bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.92,0:39:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.23,0:39:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也有包袱的  唐娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got baggage, too, Donna.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.97,0:39:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone does.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.19,0:39:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果能让你好受些的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if it makes you feel any better,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.46,0:39:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以叫我的中间名\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can call me by my middle name...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.56,0:39:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朗尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.46,0:39:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得道格就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think "Doug" will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.54,0:39:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.91,0:39:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还继续向上帝祈祷  因为如果是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep praying to God because if it is God --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.43,0:39:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你觉得不是  但如果是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know you think it isn't, but if it is --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.78,0:39:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么他给我看的幻觉  我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he's showing me something I don't know what to do with.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.45,0:39:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.73,0:39:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.84,0:40:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法的笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.28,0:40:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.70,0:40:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他是告诉我  我必须回去怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he's telling me I have to go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.45,0:40:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他是要说  打败黑暗的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he's saying that's where the answer is
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.88,0:40:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个  怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}to beating the darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.18,0:40:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  不是  不是  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, no. No, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.70,0:40:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这些幻觉是不是上帝给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if these visions are coming from God
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.73,0:40:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是公共电视网什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or PBS or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.14,0:40:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们已经试过那条路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've been down that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.80,0:40:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和那笼子有关的  就是自杀行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything having to do with that cage is -- it -- it's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.99,0:40:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最了解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you of all people know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.01,0:40:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.67,0:40:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.80,0:40:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.94,0:40:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.

